  "decision_conditions": [
    "The submitted information fails to demonstrate compliance with Condition 20 of planning permission 22/00864/FUL, which requires the submission and approval of a contamination risk assessment and any necessary remediation strategy prior to the commencement of development. The development was commenced and completed before the condition was discharged, and the information provided does not adequately address identified contamination risks. As the condition is pre-commencement in nature, it cannot be discharged retrospectively. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy (2012)."
